cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reproduce the experiments, please cite this repository and the associated article when available."
title: "Federated Learning for Industrial Bearing Condition Monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research software for centralized SOM anomaly detection,
  federated learning with FedAvg, IID and non-IID client partitioning,
  client dropout, sensor noise, stale updates, persistent failures,
  combined industrial reliability stress testing, and preliminary
  reliability-aware federated aggregation using the NASA IMS bearing dataset.
authors:
  - family-names: "Hanafi"
    given-names: "M. Yassine"
    affiliation: "Independent research project"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - industrial condition monitoring
  - anomaly detection
  - NASA IMS
  - bearing fault diagnosis
  - industrial cyber-physical systems
  - FedAvg
  - non-IID federated learning
  - client reliability
  - predictive maintenance
license: MIT
